{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/771479-lexington-ky-lexicon-april-22-24-2016-v-da-larp","id":771479,"title":"Lexington, KY - Lexicon (April 22-24, 2016) V:DA LARP","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-22T07:55:01-08:00","id":771479,"title":"Lexington, KY - Lexicon (April 22-24, 2016) V:DA LARP","content":"For two centuries, the Republic of Venice has wielded unprecedented influence in the eastern Mediterranean. Its naval might and its vast contributions to the Crusades have extended its holdings from Italy to the Holy Land itself. Sea trade flows in Venetian hulls, post-Roman city-states move to the counsel of Venetian political advisors, and the jewels of sacked Constantinople glitter in Venetian palaces and cathedrals. Today's sunrise reveals Venice's golden age.<br /> <br /> Tonight's sunset reveals Venice's dark mirror. For four centuries, High Prince Marco Dandolo has steered the Venetian ship of state. Heads of merchant houses and princes of the church alike are his pawns. The Republic's Cainites have flourished under his rule. Venice itself is neutral ground in the eternal struggles of the elders. Across the far-flung Venetian holdings, Kindred enjoy prosperity and secrecy, even as the War of Princes and the Inquisition set Europe alight. But peace enforced by elder arts and Caine's Covenant has only prolonged ancient quarrels between the High Prince's subordinate elders.<br /> <br /> Now the High Prince calls a council on the eve of Ascension Day, when Venice ceremonially weds the sea to celebrate its maritime dominion. The last such council, in 1205, saw a distribution of Constantinople's seized wealth and secret lore to the High Prince's most loyal and capable subjects. It also saw Venice's canals run crimson with the covert resolution of age-old scores.<br /> <br /> From every land the Republic's seas touch, Cainite delegations sail to Venice. Some hunger for their ruler's favor. Some thirst for the rewards of service. Some bare fangs in anticipation of finding their bitterest enemies far from home and haven. And the Venetian court smiles and welcomes them all.<br /> <hr /><br /> Bound to the Sea will be a two-night LARP at Lexicon 2016, April 22-24, held at the Clarion Convention Center in Lexington, Kentucky. The game is set in Venice of 1242. Rules will be the By Night Studios edition of Mind's Eye Theatre with slight modifications to accommodate the Dark Ages setting.<br /> <br /> More game info at: <a href=\"http://www.lexmasqlarp.com/wiki/Lexicon_2016\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.lexmasqlarp.com/wiki/Lexicon_2016</a><br /> <br /> More convention info at: <a href=\"http://lexicongaming.com/2016/\" target=\"_blank\">http://lexicongaming.com/2016/</a><br /> <br /> - C.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Clayton A. Oliver | Formerly Ubiquitous<br /> <br /> <i>When the half-light starts to rise/And the long gone come back again<br /> After the shortcuts and the highs/Comes the pain<br /> And the rain</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2966-tegyrius","name":"Tegyrius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2966_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}